    "@en": "Time expressions"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**Il giorno prima** (el día anterior), **anni prima** (años antes), **due ore dopo** (dos horas después), **nello stesso tempo** (al mismo tiempo).",
     "@en": "**Il giorno prima** (the day before), **anni prima** (years before), **due ore dopo** (two hours later), **nello stesso tempo** (at the same time)."
    },
    {
     "@es": "Son útiles para ubicar los hechos en la historia.",
     "@en": "They are useful to locate the facts in history."
    }
   ]
  },
